WEBVTT

00:02:00.636 --> 00:02:01.216
Thank you.

00:02:01.404 --> 00:02:02.244
Thank you.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Hope you enjoyed the ball.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:04.920
Pretty Cinderella, you're unhappy, I can see.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:09.580
I'm your fairy godmother, listen to me.

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:14.660
Cry your little eyes, there is no need to cry at all.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:19.400
So kind and gentle, you'll go to the ball.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:23.580
Go fetch me a pumpkin, a large one, my dear.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:27.570
Six mice and two lizards and bring them right here.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:37.960
I don't think they are.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:03.440
No!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:06.860
You can never be half as happy as me.

00:04:07.612 --> 00:04:16.572
I'm so overjoyed to be with you, and this is why I was almost cut up for pumpkin pie.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:16.470
lady remember when the clock strikes 12 you must be home by then for should you fail to be in bed

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:21.410
you'll be in rags again remember remember

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:00.800
Thank you.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:20.600
Cinder

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.450
Ba-ba-ba-bee

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.070
Ba-ba-ba-ba-bee

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:33.260
wear a throne chair.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:31.140
We'll be right back.

00:10:10.044 --> 00:10:11.444
My fault, why, you impudent thing.

00:10:11.484 --> 00:10:12.324
Oh, shut up, you jealous.

00:10:12.484 --> 00:10:13.004
How dare you?

00:10:13.004 --> 00:10:14.024
For two things, I'd slap your face.

00:10:14.044 --> 00:10:14.424
Oh, you really?

00:10:14.524 --> 00:10:15.864
What are you going to do about it?
